{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13d5_level_act13d5_05_end",
  "groupId": "act13d5",
  "stageId": "act13d5_05",
  "title": "斯沃瑪影片",
  "storyCode": "MN-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8cce32c9a019431909410fdc010c4de391370550d42f88064ff600e0a8f8825b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔 5下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_arena_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "騎士競賽，到底是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑟奇亞克先生，您認為呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......別胡鬧了，恰爾內，我很忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直接說，你要做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遺憾......呼嘯騎士團決定換下您的特錦賽首發陣容。那位新加入的援護騎士同樣名列前茅，團體賽中，他的法術可以派上用場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......這和說好的不一樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，允諾的定金還是會交付的。不過騎士團替補的稅金是不一樣的，你明白，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀......別衝動，你的孩子馬上就要過十歲生日，你沒必要因為攻擊一個微不足道的我而丟了工作......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼嘯騎士團付給你的錢依舊很多，至少今年，你無需再努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我需要的是正賽名額！我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就看你自己的表現了，瑟奇亞克，總有辦法活下去的，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種事情隨便找個員工聯繫我就好，為什麼要親自來這裡找我？發言人都這麼閒的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......別誤會，我也不是專程來找您的，我只是來確認一些賽事安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們似乎有些太鬆懈了，各個賽區都出現了一些小小的問題，也給一些不法分子可乘之機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你是在威脅我？威脅“塑膠”騎士瑟奇亞克幫你做骯髒事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪裡的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想要做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有兩位在意的騎士需要迅速準備到時刻可以出場的狀態......但遺憾的是，他們的積分明顯還未夠格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呸......你們真想讓騎士出線，有的是手段......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別這麼說，偶爾也需要遵守規則，隱秘一些行事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——利用律法和違反律法完全是兩回事，而其本質差異在於，當事人是否擁有這個本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要您點頭同意，積分轉讓的額外賽事和手續全部由我們安排。當然，這樣一來您在呼嘯騎士團內部的問題我也會稍加處理......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人恰爾內",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_106",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您意下如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_arena_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——失效！踏步騎士的鞋底加速裝置失去了作用！！驟然的減速讓他猛然摔在了終點線前——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "衝線——！！冠軍是來自輝落騎士團的藤蘿騎士！！而瑪莉婭·臨光緊隨其後——斬獲壓線！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而失去了鞋底加速的踏步騎士直接從第二位落後到了第七——！！真可惜啊踏步騎士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "騎士裝備的重要性不言而喻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而艾倫精選公司為各位提供全面的保養、維修、升級與設備安排管理，貼心的會員制度，為騎士們準備了無微不至的套餐！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......亞軍嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這樣......離特錦賽就更進一步了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（佐菲婭姑母......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_sportsbar"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢，意料之外的客人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請找個位置隨便坐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "馬丁......真的是你，過去大紅大紫的騎士如今只開著這一家小酒吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老馬丁早已經被剝奪了騎士身份，如今靠著積蓄混口飯吃，如此罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“塑膠”瑟奇亞克是怎麼找到這兒來的？不瞞你說，我這家酒吧很少迎接現役騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在的瑪莉婭可是大紅人，你的酒吧早就刊登在昨晚的娛樂新聞上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......大紅人，一杯“紅色雪絨花”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這杯我請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "榮幸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼嘯守衛的訓練基地離這裡可不算近，不會讓你白跑一趟的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，來到之前對手的大本營，是為了來刺探軍情，好在特錦賽上報一箭之仇的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不會在特錦賽登場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚯......呼嘯守衛的決定？我以為你和贊助商的私人關係還不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，私人關係，和企業談關係，就像和天災談戀愛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，做決定的是更上面一層......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "騎士協會？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不止......比如，商業聯合會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你想說什麼，老馬丁，你在想“一個區區塑膠騎士怎麼會把事情變這麼大條的”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是有自知之明的，沒有人會為了一個懂得聽從安排的騎士做到這個地步，所以問題出在別的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坊間始終流傳著一個說法，耀騎士並不是感染者，她被逐出卡西米爾這件事，也沒有那麼簡單......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我毫不知情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別這麼警惕......我沒有在打探你的意思，老馬丁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是想讓恰爾內知道，戲弄貴族是要付出代價的......而我想瑪莉婭·臨光應該也在他的視野之內，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......騎士聯手起來向協會抗議？這種事情總沒有好下場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是不想任人宰割。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你的酒......老馬丁，多嘴一句......我年輕時候，是看了你的比賽才決定成為騎士的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來你選錯路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，這不是剛準備自己踩出一條路來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次再見，老馬丁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_107",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑟奇亞克，最後勸你一句......小心些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哼，騎士從不需要在那些商販面前低頭，呼嘯騎士團會同意我的看法的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_kxstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“焰尾”索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，已經跟了我們這麼久，差不多該露個面了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“焰尾”索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，氣勢洶洶的......我可不喜歡這樣的粉絲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“焰尾”索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“等等——你們的弓是——你是！？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“焰尾”索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你以為我會這麼驚訝嗎，無胄盟的刺客？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“焰尾”索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯......原來你們是這個造型啊，一直躲躲藏藏的，從來沒有騎士見過你們的模樣，你們這工作還真陰暗啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“焰尾”索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "機會難得——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰毫騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“焰尾”索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我們好好打一架吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_nearllivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——姑母——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊.....叔叔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一段時間沒有管你，你似乎越來越不知分寸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你打算什麼時候停手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上級已經三番五次問我關於你的事情了，每天我都要在宣發部門處理關於你的麻煩......光是向領導請示情況就占了我一半的工作時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在立刻去騎士協會退出騎士競技，你根本不知道自己在做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那樣的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要自尋死路，瑪莉婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也是臨光家的孩子，應當知曉分寸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是在特錦賽之前的小打小鬧，也就由著你去了，但現在你引起過多關注了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要以為你真的能闖入特錦賽。也不要你以為你現在面對的敵人就是騎士競技的極限了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是我不想坐視臨光家被剝奪貴族——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——虛榮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說過，臨光不需要如今下作的騎士協會認可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道他們不認可我們，先祖的功績就不復存在了？荒唐！這麼多年來，臨光家從未靠他人來捍衛過自己的地位！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果做不到，那就放棄。不懂得放棄的人......死路一條。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叔叔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你受瑪嘉烈的影響太深了，瑪莉婭，她到最後都沒有認識到自己的愚昧，你不該如此盲從她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別那麼看著我，我有說錯嗎？想在規則中戰勝規則的主人？癡人說夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道瑪嘉烈的脾氣，本來她最看不起的就是商業化的騎士競技，我還以為她能有點骨氣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果呢？她還是走投無路地選擇用騎士競技這條路彰顯她的“信念”，是啊，“信念”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她能改變任何東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叔叔......不要這樣說姐姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她唯一改變的，就是企業對臨光家的態度！唯一做到的，就是讓病重的父親不得不分神處理她捅下的婁子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“耀騎士”這個稱呼不該授予她，她根本無力支撐這樣的光榮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叔叔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你呢......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你現在......難道不也是在為企業工作嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不允許我做競技騎士，那難道低聲下氣地為企業工作，坐視臨光家失去騎士地位，這就可以了嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還年輕，所以我不會責備你的無知......但是你應該尊重長輩的意見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又說這種話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡西米爾人......世世代代建立起的高樓廣廈灑下了陰影，你躲在家鄉，躲在長輩們的庇護下，你能知道些什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道你真以為，你一個初出茅廬的年輕騎士能夠有什麼作為？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "邊疆的要塞日出時，屬於烏薩斯人的城邦高樓會劃過地平線的雲端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "高塔的侍從為了博貴族一笑而在賽場上敷衍地戰鬥，年輕的蒸汽騎士穿著舊時的甲胄，來此磨練技藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "賞金獵人和強盜們碾過一處又一處貧苦的村莊，各大城邦卻想著如何建立更多的競技場。一個村莊的收成和稅金比例堪稱滑稽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這一切都比不過父親在病榻上的最後一聲歎息，不是因為瑪嘉烈，不是因為你的父母——那是父親對整個卡西米爾的悲歎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你讓我如何不失望？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說得對，瑪莉婭，你說得對，我現在一無是處，不過是企業豢養的馱獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......經理？不，我只是有一些私事......不，私事當然沒有工作重要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "專案會議？是今天？不，我沒有忘記......抱歉，非常抱歉，對不起，是的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很快就會到......什麼？不，他沒有我瞭解這個專案的進程......是的，對不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼......請他代勞為我出席......是的，抱歉......負責人的任務？這......是的，這一定是最後一次了，不會有下次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次請您撤除我的職務。是，一定，我保證。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的非常抱歉，經理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我沒有太多時間可以浪費了，瑪莉婭，給我一個答覆，現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是不會改變想法的，叔叔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和瑪嘉烈一樣......讓我感到厭惡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們的父母不會以現在的你們為榮。自己冷靜冷靜，反省一下自己到底是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......請不要再說了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪恩納",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_108",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知天高地厚......那就自求多福吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
